INSTRUCTIONS TO VIEW REPORTS
----------------------------
To view the assessment reports correctly:

1. Download ALL attached HTML files to the SAME folder on your computer
   Examples:
   - Windows: C:\Reports\OS_Patching\
   - macOS/Linux: ~/Downloads/os_patching/

2. Open "os_patching_dashboard.html" in your web browser
   - This is the main executive dashboard
   - It contains summary metrics and a searchable host table
   - Use the search box to filter hosts by name or status

3. Click "View evidence →" links in the dashboard to view individual host details
   - The dashboard will open the corresponding host HTML files
   - All files MUST be in the same folder for links to work correctly

IMPORTANT NOTES
---------------
• Do NOT rename the HTML files - dashboard links depend on exact filenames
• Keep all files in the same directory for proper navigation
• Reports are self-contained and do not require internet access
• For security, do not forward these reports to unauthorized recipients

ASSESSMENT INTERPRETATION
-------------------------
• PASS: Complete evidence, successful patch job, no remaining updates
• INCOMPLETE: Missing or invalid evidence, or unconfirmed job outcome
• PATCH FAILED: Recorded patch job failure
• UPDATES REMAIN: Available update candidates remain after patching

